        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>环境版本：6.2.1</p>

<p>环境规模：532计算</p>

<p>问题描述：1.27+vpc容器集群大量pod状态异常排查</p>


<p>获取方式：ESonCall微信</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/355970" alt="4ca73b8641f32c76a8b689d743394d0-20250519-015140.jpg" height="1080" width="1919" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
